on Wait ticks
  [  0] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [  2] extcall 48 .............................. startTimer()
  [  5] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [  8] get 7 ................................... <the timer>
  [ 10] getparam 0 .............................. <ticks>
  [ 12] lt ...................................... <the timer < ticks>
  [ 13] jmpifz [ 22] ............................ repeat while the timer < ticks
  [ 16] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 18] extcall 27 .............................. nothing()
  [ 20] endrepeat [  5]
  [ 22] ret
end
